  "deliberateDifferences": [
    {
      "what": "The Rust toast prefixes a Critical title with \"Critical: \"; no Svelte surface does.",
      "why": "Memo 022 D5. The Svelte tier projects tone and label, and its toast projection lives in the client tier where the prefix has not been applied. A real gap, narrower than it looks, and the only one left in this fixture."
